      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Embarquement: Egypte - Le Caire, le renouveau du quartier de Darb Al-Ahmar features ISMC's Professor Pradines and looks at Cairo - Africa's second most populated city and examines its rich history centring on the Darb Al Ahmar quarter.  Professor Pradines has led a number of excavations in Cairo most notably as Director of Excavations of the Walls of Cairo."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The documentary is directed by Sabine Heaulme and was produced by the Aga Khan Trust for Culture and TV5 Monde."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The documentary is available to view "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "here",
